t by flight - so cruise itineraries are unaffected. It only matters for overland Thailand-Cambodia travel.","source":"kh.usembassy.gov","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"When is the best time to cruise the Cambodian Mekong?","a":"Roughly November-April (dry, cooler); the Tonle Sap is highest and most navigable after the wet season (Oct-Dec), when the lake and its floating villages are fullest.","source":"uniworld.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"Which lines cruise the Cambodian Mekong?","a":"Confirmed: Aqua Expeditions (Aqua Mekong), Pandaw, Scenic, Uniworld, CroisiEurope and Viking - most on Vietnam-Cambodia itineraries, Siem Reap to Phnom Penh via the Tonle Sap and Kampong Cham.","source":"adventure-life.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"Is Angkor Wat worth building the trip around?","a":"Yes - Angkor is the largest religious monument on earth and the reason most cruises terminate at Siem Reap; pair the temples with the Tonle Sap floating villages and a Phnom Penh Khmer-Rouge history day for the full Cambodian arc.","source":"adventure-life.com","si_tag":"culture"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Cambodia Mekong Travel Guide: River Cruises, Angkor Wat & the Tonle Sap","meta_description":"Plan Cambodia''s Mekong - Phnom Penh to Siem Reap river cruises (Aqua Expeditions, Pandaw, Scenic, Uniworld), Angkor Wat, the Tonle Sap floating villages and the Khmer-Rouge history sites, with the real safety picture.","slug":"mekong-cambodia","primary_keyword":"Cambodia Mekong travel guide","long_tail":["Cambodia Mekong river cruise Phnom Penh Siem Reap 2026","Angkor Wat sunrise","Tonle Sap floating villages","is Cambodia safe to visit 2026","Cambodia landmine safety","Aqua Mekong Cambodia"],"search_language":"km-KH","local_keywords":["Mekong Kampuchea","Angkor Wat","Tonle Sap","Phnom Penh","Siem Reap"],"hreflang":["en","km-KH"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-29","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","nam