026-ho-chi-minh-city-to-hanoi","accessed":"2026-07-29","source_carried":true,"source_basis":"carried from the dossier lane source; the proper noun ''Ho Chi Minh City'' from the jewel name appears in the URL. NOT a human read of the jewel."},{"name":"Village cycling + sampan the canals","si_tag":"globaladv","status":"future","tier":"essential","price_band":"~$25-90/pp","timing":"year-round","draw_rank":1,"hook":"the delta''s active morning — cycle unpaved village lanes past orchards, then paddle a sampan through the narrow canals","si":"adventure","blurb":"the delta''s active morning — cycle unpaved village lanes past orchards, then paddle a sampan through the narrow canals","when":"year-round","commission":"operator/affiliate 10-15%","wells":["stay"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["adventure"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"primary","culinary":"destination","culture":"destination","deepdive":"destination","river":"destination","romance":"destination","senior":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":15,"commission_lane":["operator","affiliate"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"},{"name":"A small-ship river honeymoon","si_tag":"romance","status":"future","tier":"premier","price_band":"~$3,000-7,000+/pp","timing":"dry Nov-Apr ideal","draw_rank":1,"hook":"a suite on an Aqua Mekong-class 5-star ship, private sampan sunset and a delta cooking dinner — a quiet, unusual river honeymoon","si":"romance","blurb":"a suite on an Aqua Mekong-class 5-star ship, private sampan sunset and a delta cooking dinner — a quiet, unusual river honeymoon","when":"dry Nov-Apr ideal","commission":"cruise-line/host 10-16%","wells":["stay","eat","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["culinary","romance"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culinary":"evidenced","culture":"destination","deepdive":"destination","river":"destination","romance":"primary","senior":"destination"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":16,"commission_lane":[],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band"},{"name":"The low-exertion river cruise","si_tag":"senior","status":"future","tier":"comfort","price_band":"~$2,500-5,000/pp","timing":"dry Nov-Apr ideal","draw_rank":1,"hook":"a gentle, all-in small-ship cruise with step-light delta excursions — a natural fit for the river-cruise senior demographic, HCMC the easy gateway","si":"senior","blurb":"a gentle, all-in small-ship cruise with step-light delta excursions — a natural fit for the river-cruise senior demographic, HCMC the easy gateway","when":"dry Nov-Apr ideal","commission":"cruise-line/DMC 10-16%","wells":["move","activities"],"wells_basis":"derived from name/blurb/hook","si_all":["river","senior"],"shelf_fit":{"adventure":"destination","culinary":"destination","culture":"destination","deepdive":"destination","river":"evidenced","romance":"destination","senior":"primary"},"commission_pct_low":10,"commission_pct_high":16,"commission_lane":["DMC"],"commission_embedded":false,"commission_basis":"band+lane"}],"faq":[{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for in the Mekong Delta?","a":"Not crime - heat, traffic and the water: the delta is hot and humid year-round, Ho Chi Minh City traffic is dense, and canal sampans are small craft (follow crew, wear the life vest). Standard SE-Asia food-and-water hygiene applies.","source":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/vietnam","si_tag":"safety"},{"q":"Is the Vietnam-Cambodia border crossing on a Mekong cruise a problem?","a":"No - the cruise river crossing at Tan Chau is open and routinely used by the ships. (Separately, some Cambodia-Thailand land borders are closed - that affects the Cambodia leg, not this Vietnamese one.)","source":"vikingrivercruises.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"When is the best time to cruise the Vietnamese Mekong?","a":"Roughly November-April, the drier cooler window, because the May-October wet season brings heavy afternoon rain and higher water - though the delta cruises year-round and high water opens more canals.","source":"aquaexpeditions.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"Which lines cruise the Vietnamese Mekong?","a":"Confirmed from Ho Chi Minh City: Viking, Aqua Expeditions, Uniworld, Scenic and Mekong Navigator - most on Vietnam-Cambodia itineraries linking the delta to Phnom Penh and Siem Reap.","source":"vikingrivercruises.com","si_tag":"river"},{"q":"What do you actually see in the Mekong Delta?","a":"River life: the Cai Be floating market, Sa Dec''s colonial streets and flower gardens, Ben Tre''s coconut canals by sampan, cooking classes with delta chefs, and - near the start - the Cu Chi tunnels of the Vietnam War.","source":"uniworld.com","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"Is the Mekong Delta good for a river-cruise honeymoon or for older travellers?","a":"Yes to both - small-ship 5-star cruising (Aqua Mekong ~40 guests) suits a quiet honeymoon, and the gentle all-in format with step-light excursions and HCMC as an easy gateway fits the river-cruise senior demographic.","source":"aquaexpeditions.com","si_tag":"romance"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Mekong Delta Vietnam Travel Guide: River Cruises, Floating Markets & Cu Chi","meta_description":"Plan Vietnam''s Mekong Delta — river cruises from Ho Chi Minh City (Viking, Aqua Expeditions, Uniworld, Scenic), Cai Be & Ben Tre by sampan, Sa Dec, cooking classes and the Cu Chi tunnels.","slug":"mekong-delta-vietnam","primary_keyword":"Mekong Delta Vietnam travel guide","long_tail":["Mekong Delta river cruise from Ho Chi Minh City 2026","Cai Be floating market","Ben Tre coconut canals sampan","Cu Chi tunnels tour","Vietnam Cambodia Mekong cruise","Aqua Mekong small-ship"],"search_language":"vi-VN","local_keywords":["Dong bang song Cuu Long","du thuyen song Mekong","cho noi Cai Be","Ben Tre","Sa Dec","dia dao Cu Chi","Thanh pho Ho Chi Minh","Tan Chau"],"hreflang":["en","vi-VN"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-29","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-29","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/vietnam","read":"2026-08-20T14:53:49Z","source_updated":"2026-06-26T12:10:13+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":[],"advisory_updated":"2026-06-24"},"si_checklist_25":{"run_date":"2026-07-29","hits":8,"misses":14,"disregarded":3,"note":"Canonical 25-SI list; sports limited to My Sports Travel (participant); spectator/prosports/compsports disregarded"},"sis_present":[{"si":"river","name":"river","status":"live"},{"si":"culture","name":"Culture & History","status":"future"},{"si":"deepdive","name":"deepdive","status":"future"},{"si":"culinary","name":"culinary","status":"future"},{"si":"globaladv","name":"adventure","status":"future"},{"si":"romance","name":"Romance, Marriages & Honeymoons","status":"future"},{"si":"senior","name":"senior","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"Aqua Mekong — 5-star small-ship suite (~40 guests)","why_ultra":"design ship with private-sampan excursion fleet, delta cooking + spa, Vietnam<->Cambodia Mekong","earning":"cruise-line/host 10-16%","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~$4,000-9,000+/pp"},{"name":"Park Hyatt Saigon / The Reverie — HCMC ultra bookend","why_ultra":"top-tier gateway stay, spa + fine dining in District 1","earning":"consortia/Virtuoso on application","virtuoso_value_add":true,"mor":"commissionable-rack","tier":"ultra","price_band":"~$300-800+/night"},{"name":"A private delta day — chartered sampan + delta chef''s table","why_ultra":"private canal boat + market-to-table lunch, chauffeured from HCMC","earning":"DMC + venue","virtuoso_value_add":false,"mor":"commissionable","tier":"luxury-ultra","price_band":"on application"}],"source_verified":"2026-07-29","hero":{"query":"The Mekong Delta, Vietnam, Vietnam"},"geo":{"lat":10.0341,"lng":105.788},"orbit":[{"id":"mekong-cambodia","jewels":11,"si":["river","culture","deepdive","culinary","adventure","romance","senior"]},{"id":"upper-mekong-laos","jewels":11,"si":["river","culture","deepdive","culinary","adventure","romance","senior"]}],"orbit_country":[]}'::jsonb, 7),
  ('raja-ampat-indonesia', '07A', 'Raja Ampat', 'Indonesia', 'The richest reef on the planet', 'live', 'verified', 'oceanAerial', 'Raja Ampat — Indonesia (Southwest Papua)', '{"liveaboard","adventure","diveglobal","ocean"}', '{}', '{"comfort","premier"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["NW-monsoon liveaboard sea, ~Oct-April (calmest/clearest); avoid Jun-Jul; seasonal inverse of Komodo; water ~28-30C","Three regions: Dampier Strait (Cape Kri - single-dive fish-count record, Blue Magic, Sardine Reef, Manta Sandy), Misool (Boo Windows, Magic Mountain, Four Kings), Wayag/north","Manta cleaning stations: Manta Sandy (Dampier) + Magic Mountain/Shadow Reef (Misool)","Fleet: Raja Ampat Aggressor (reseller line held), Explorer Ventures (reseller line held), Emperor Harmoni/Raja Laut, Master Indo Master, luxury phinisi (Damai/Dewi Nusantara/Mermaid/Arenui/Coralia)","Raja Ampat/Southwest Papua outside both; FCDO points Papua caution at the highlands); nearest chamber Waisai but readiness not assured - evac to Manado/Bali; Wayag temporarily closed (verify) - all verified 2026-08-09"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 / 118 ambulance (verify)","hospital":"Waisai (Waigeo) clinic; Sorong for referral; serious care routes to Manado or Bali (verify)","hyperbaric":"Nearest chamber at Waisai (Waigeo), ~2-4h from sites (+62-951-3173358) but readiness NOT assured - no reliably operational chamber in Papua per dive-medicine sources; DAN-documented case evacuated a diver to Bali (~2,000 km, ~7h via Sorong); Manado the other referral. Confirm status + carry evacuation cover (source: papuaparadise.com + stayrajaampat.com, 2026-08-09)","regional_hazard":"LIVE: Wayag + Manyaifun/Batangpele reported temporarily closed over nickel-mining disputes - verify northern-route access (rajaampatbiodiversity.com, 2026-08-09)","no_fly_after_diving":"18-24h (DAN)","malaria":"present in Raja Ampat/Papua - discuss prophylaxis (verify)","yellow_fever":"only if arriving from an endemic country","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia","read":"2026-08-20T14:47:44Z","page_updated":"2026-08-16T12:31:33+01:00","source_country":"indonesia","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"posture":"book-freely","fcdo_zones":[{"name":"within 7km of the crater of Mount Lewotobi Laki-Laki on Flores Island, East Nusa Tenggara Province","lvl":4,"posture":"all"},{"name":"within 5km of the crater of Mount Sinabung in Karo Regency, North Sumatra","lvl":4,"posture":"all"},{"name":"within 3km of the crater of Mount Marapi in West Sumatra","lvl":4,"posture":"all"},{"name":"within 5km of the crater of Mount Semeru in Lumajang Regency, East Java","lvl":4,"posture":"all","note":"Also, in the south-east of Mount Semeru, to within 500m from any riverbank of the Besuk Kobokan river for 13km from the crater."},{"name":"within 7km of the crater of Mount Ruang in Northern Sulawesi","lvl":4,"posture":"all"},{"name":"within 7km of the crater of Mount Ibu in North Maluku Province","lvl":4,"posture":"all"}],"dive_emergency_numbers_verified":{"read":"2026-08-30","numbers":{"+62-951-3173358":"Hyperbaric chamber, Waisai, Raja Ampat (ext. 102) — stayrajaampat.com / divernet.com, read 2026-08-30"},"_rule":"Each number above was read from the authority named beside it on the date shown. ⛔ A number with no entry here has NOT been verified and must not be presented as an emergency contact."}},"timing":{"peak":"Oct-Apr (NW monsoon - calmest, clearest)","shoulder":"May & Sep (season edges)","green":"Jun-Aug (SE monsoon; roughest Jun-Jul; boats reposition to Komodo)","booking_lead":"peak preferred vessels ~6-12 months; shoulder nearer term; confirm per-vessel","off_season_specials":"season-edge shoulder weeks lower demand","event_peaks":"Oct-Apr window is the demand season; manta stations run within it","fire_date":"wet-season fire Jun-Jul (inverse of the Komodo campaign; sell as a paired Ind